1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,600
We hid 3 facts in an AI agent's context.

2
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:06,652
Then the context filled up, past its budget.

3
00:00:06,952 --> 00:00:10,302
The harness kept the head and the tail, and cut the middle.

4
00:00:10,502 --> 00:00:13,102
2 of the 3 facts were cut.

5
00:00:13,302 --> 00:00:17,502
Asked for the account code, the agent filed the invoice under "overage".

6
00:00:17,802 --> 00:00:27,302
Same history, 27 seeds, four ways to make room. Each loses a different fact.

7
00:00:27,502 --> 00:00:31,002
The agent fails on exactly the fact that was cut.
